              </p>
              <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0fdf4, #f7fee7); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-green);">
                <h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0; color: #065f46; font-size: 1rem;">What you'll learn:</h3>
