                    <h4 style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0; color: #065f46; font-size: 0.9rem;">Management Tools:</h4>
                    <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 1rem; color: #065f46; font-size: 0.85rem;">
                      <li>Status updates and progress tracking</li>
                      <li>Direct communication with requestors</li>
                      <li>File attachment handling</li>
                      <li>Deadline management</li>
                    </ul>
                  </div>
